      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KILL YOUR SMILE (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (20.09) in a Free For All at Capalaba. Goes very well here at the trip finding the frame in each of three starts. Boasts a strong record from this draw with three wins and two minor placings from six starts. Has ability and can bounce back. BONNIE IS BOUJEE (6) has been a little hard to follow, finishing out of the placings latest but was in winning form two back scoring in a Mix 5 at this track. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. PROFESSOR STARR (8) missed the frame last time when fifth (26.03) at this track but prior to that had three placings in a row. Form here sound including five wins. Worth another chance. FROM A DISTANCE (4) profiles nicely over this trip.",
